<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3351163070"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1878095294"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Trace"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="milet"/><amll:meta key="album" value="The Story of Us"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:00.333"><div begin="00:07.481" end="03:48.218"><p begin="00:07.481" end="00:11.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">夜の隙間にあなたがいた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就存在于夜晚的罅隙里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru no su ki ma ni a na ta ga i ta</span></p><p begin="00:11.452" end="00:15.226" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">名前を呼んだ声がした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听到有人在呼唤我的名</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ma e wo yo n da ko e ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:15.398" end="00:19.318" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">思い出せる何度だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论多少次都能够忆起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da se ru na n do da 't te</span></p><p begin="00:19.603" end="00:21.456" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">You were right here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾经就在这里</span></p><p begin="00:21.530" end="00:23.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Right here with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就在我身旁</span></p><p begin="00:24.179" end="00:31.913" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">そう、心臓から指先まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种感觉从心脏蔓延至指尖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u shi n zo u ka ra yu bi sa ki ma de</span></p><p begin="00:31.913" end="00:35.603" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">あなたに触れたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要碰触你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ni fu re ta i</span></p><p begin="00:35.897" end="00:39.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">守りたい 隣にいたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要守护你 想要陪着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma mo ri ta i to na ri ni i ta i</span></p><p begin="00:39.442" end="00:47.155" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">また会う日まで なんて行く宛もないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管在与你重逢前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a u hi ma de</span></p><p begin="00:47.426" end="00:54.527" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">その足跡をまた たどっていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我依然循着你留下的足迹前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no a shi a to wo ma ta ta do 't te i ta</span></p><p begin="00:54.920" end="00:59.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">誰よりも あなたに言えるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿我比任何人都更能对你倾诉真心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re yo ri mo a na ta ni i e ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:59.476" end="01:03.322" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">どこでも あなたに見えるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论身在何处我都希望你可以看见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko de mo a na ta ni mi e ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:03.422" end="01:11.249" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">雨の日もずっと 灯してた光を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连雨天也会一直将灯光点亮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a me no hi mo zu 't to to mo shi te ta hi ka ri wo</span></p><p begin="01:11.460" end="01:15.333" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">いつかは 闇を晴らすように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿有朝一日能驱散黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ha ya mi wo ha ra su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:15.451" end="01:19.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">あなたに この手届くように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿我最后可以碰触到你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ni ko no te to do ku yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:19.563" end="01:27.976" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">言葉にしないでおいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暂且将真心话置于心底</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ni shi na i de o i te</span></p><p begin="01:31.358" end="01:35.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">遠回りして気がついた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">历经兜兜转转我才察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ma wa ri shi te ki ga tsu i ta</span></p><p begin="01:35.508" end="01:39.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">あなたと過ごした時間は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有你与我共度的那段岁月</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to su go shi ta ji ka n ha</span></p><p begin="01:39.422" end="01:43.285" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">まるで枯れない花束で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍若永不凋零的花束般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ru de ka re na i ha na ta ba de</span></p><p begin="01:43.441" end="01:47.279" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">心の中 咲き続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将在我心中恒久盛放</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro no na ka sa ki tsu zu ke ru</span></p><p begin="01:47.409" end="01:55.303" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">寂しくないなんて 強がってしまうけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说什么我并不寂寞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa mi shi ku na i na n te</span></p><p begin="01:55.422" end="02:02.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">息するたび思う 会いたいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次呼吸都在想你 渴望见你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki su ru ta bi o mo u a i ta i yo</span></p><p begin="02:02.905" end="02:07.258" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">誰よりも あなたに言えるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿我比任何人都更能对你倾诉真心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re yo ri mo a na ta ni i e ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:07.428" end="02:11.351" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">どこでも あなたに見えるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论身在何处我都希望你可以看见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko de mo a na ta ni mi e ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:11.371" end="02:19.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">優しい火 ずっと 絶やさずに守るよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会守护温柔火光 只为让它永不熄灭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi i hi zu 't to ta ya sa zu ni ma mo ru yo</span></p><p begin="02:19.444" end="02:23.306" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">例えば道に迷おうとも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕在路途中迷失方向</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba mi chi ni ma yo o u to mo</span></p><p begin="02:23.421" end="02:27.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">あなたは一人じゃないこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你依然不是孤身一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ha hi to ri ja na i ko to</span></p><p begin="02:27.530" end="02:35.776" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">必ず覚えておいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请务必记得这点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na ra zu o bo e te o i te</span></p><p begin="02:39.367" end="02:41.501" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I'll be by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会守候在你身旁</span></p><p begin="02:39.536" end="02:41.347" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">(When the night comes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(当黑夜降临之时)</span></p><p begin="02:41.511" end="02:43.363" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">In the darkness<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(在漆黑的世界里)</span></p><p begin="02:43.543" end="02:45.338" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">I'll be your light<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我会做你的明灯)</span></p><p begin="02:45.597" end="02:47.219" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">I'll be your eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我会做你的慧眼)</span></p><p begin="02:47.571" end="02:49.385" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">All our tears'll fade away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有的泪水终将消散</span></p><p begin="02:47.570" end="02:49.312" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I'll never leave you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我将永远不会离开你)</span></p><p begin="02:49.445" end="02:51.277" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Yah I will guide you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(Yah 我会引领你)</span></p><p begin="02:51.536" end="02:53.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">I follow your trace<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我会循着你的轨迹)</span></p><p begin="02:53.590" end="02:55.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">I follow your trace)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我会循着你的轨迹)</span></p><p begin="02:55.523" end="03:07.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Run to my arms and stay stay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔入我的怀抱 留下来吧</span></p><p begin="03:07.546" end="03:14.633" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在</span></p><p begin="03:14.947" end="03:19.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">誰よりも あなたに言えるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿我比任何人都更能对你倾诉真心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re yo ri mo a na ta ni i e ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:19.446" end="03:23.343" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">どこでも あなたに見えるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论身在何处我都希望你可以看见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko de mo a na ta ni mi e ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:23.462" end="03:31.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">雨の日もずっと 灯してた光を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连雨天也会一直将灯光点亮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a me no hi mo zu 't to to mo shi te ta hi ka ri wo</span></p><p begin="03:31.430" end="03:35.395" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">いつかは 闇を晴らすように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿有朝一日能驱散黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ha ya mi wo ha ra su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:35.446" end="03:39.378" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">あなたに この手届くように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿我最后可以碰触到你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ni ko no te to do ku yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:39.556" end="03:48.218" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">言葉にしないでおいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暂且将真心话置于心底</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ni shi na i de o i te</span></p></div></body></tt>